{"context":"FND local-direct-deploy + 4 spike done (ssh-transport, e2e, race, ux) membuktikan feasibility deploy dari local via SSH single VPS. Tanpa ADR, ada risiko: (1) auth secret leak di log, (2) race local-vs-CI corrupt state tanpa flock, (3) verification-before-trust bypass jika Activate tidak re-verify stored artifact (HIGH gap spike e2e), (4) audit spoof tanpa binding ke SSH principal, (5) prod tanpa guard. Keputusan arsitektur diperlukan untuk menyatukan transport, lifecycle enforcement, dan guard per-env secara deterministik.","decision":"Anvil mengadopsi **SSH Full-Lifecycle Transport** sebagai единственный transport untuk `anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e` (single VPS/bare-metal):\n\n1) **Trigger CI-agnostic, execution server-owned:** Build+Verify di local (identity-from-content sha-256), lalu artifact streaming via SSH (scp/rsync) dengan atomic `tmp.\u003crand\u003e -\u003e fsync -\u003e rename`. Server tetap pemilik lifecycle: Negotiate capability (deployment.Negotiate) → Install(projectID, artifactPath) → VerifyStoredArtifact + RequireVerified → Activate(releaseID) via ServerReleaseCoordinator. State O_NOFOLLOW, flock, idempotent retry.\n2) **Verification-before-trust enforced dua layer:** Install wajib VerifyBeforeTrust PASS + verifyStoredArtifact (manifest equality+checksum); Activate WAJIB RequireVerified(storeArtifactPath) sebelum ExtractArtifact (menutup HIGH gap spike e2e); Rollback re-verify archived artifact sebelum promote.\n3) **Konfigurasi tunggal (ADR-005):** `server.targets[env]` di anvil.yaml (host,user,sshKeyPath) — tidak ada per-subsystem config. Env var DEPLOY_SSH_KEY adalah override, bukan source utama.\n4) **Guard per-env:** dev allow local; staging allow dengan --confirm; prod CI-only default, local hanya jika allowlist di anvil.yaml + confirm prompt + audit binding ke SSH authenticated principal (bukan string DeployerUser spoofable). SSH host-key verification wajib (reject bypass prod).\n5) **Observability \u0026 security:** Audit JSON-lines O_APPEND+Sync, mode 0600, hash-chain, redaction via RedactSecrets/SanitizeLogLine (tidak print KeyPath/private key), error classification KindTimeout/Unreachable/AuthFail/PermissionDenied dengan Guidance actionable, exit codes terdokumentasi, envelope v1 untuk --json.","consequences":"### Positive\n- Konsisten dengan ADR-003 deterministic lifecycle \u0026 ADR-006 state: semua deploy lewat Coordinator yang sama, tidak ada \"direct copy+symlink\" bypass.\n- Idempotency \u0026 atomicity terbukti: 50 push p95 \u003c30s, retry tidak corrupt (spike ssh), 8-goroutine race tidak duplicate (spike race).\n- Security guard per-env + audit binding menutup spoof \u0026 repudiation; redaction menutup info disclosure.\n- Hybrid aman: preview/dev boleh local, prod tetap CI-gated — tidak memaksa fleet.\n\n### Negative / Cost\n- Tambahan validasi di Activate/Rollback (performance minor) + hash-chain audit (storage).\n- Prod allowlist + confirm menambah friction — disengaja.\n- Flock serializes concurrent deploy — latency naik saat kontensi, tapi mencegah corruption.\n\n### Risks \u0026 Mitigations\n- TOCTOU stored artifact tamper → mit: RequireVerified di Activate.\n- SSH secret leak → mit: redaction + ssh-agent preferred.\n- 0644 audit writable → mit: chmod 0600 + hash-chain + SIEM ship.\n- Network partial write → mit: atomic tmp+rename + checksum re-verify.","alternativesConsidered":"### A. Full lifecycle via SSH (dipilih)\nPro: Konsisten philosophy, verification-before-trust utuh, rollback first-class, e2e \u0026 race PASS. Kontra: Perlu guard \u0026 flock.\n\n### B. Direct copy + symlink (rejected)\nCopy file mentah lalu symlink. Rejected: violate verification-before-trust \u0026 state-before-assumptions, no rollback semantics, contradict ADR-003. Spike FND sudah menolak.\n\n### C. Registry di tengah (publish ke registry lalu pull di server)\nPro: Deduplikasi artifact. Kontra: Tambah hop \u0026 latency, butuh registry reachable dari server isolated; untuk VPS tunggal over-engineering. Ditolak untuk MVP, bisa dipertimbangkan post-MVP jika fleet.\n\n### D. Preview-only channel tanpa prod guard (rejected)\nProd tetap CI, dev local. Ditolak sebagai final: spike evidence menunjukkan guard per-env lebih fleksibel daripada hard split; dev/staging/prod guard memungkinkan kompromi yang sama dengan keamanan lebih halus."}